## Where configuration comes from

`[[ project_name ]]` takes its input from its arguments: see [CLI Reference](CLI-Reference). It has no settings engine and no config file of its own (template-python decision 0011).

If it ever needs more, the rule is: environment variables named `[[ env_prefix ]]<KEY>`, read in one place; a file, if any, is TOML, read with `tomllib`; and the order in which they win is written here. A tool that runs as root takes nothing from its caller's environment unless it says so on this page.

